# TaskWipe

Follow `docs/HOW_IT_WAS_BUILT.md` for what already works. Follow `docs/NEXT.md` for queued work.

If asked to continue the product, do the first undone slice in `docs/NEXT.md` and stop at that slice's Stop line. Do not treat `NEXT.md` as the current product.

Standing rules, speed budget, and out-of-scope list are in `docs/NEXT.md`. Do not rewrite them here.
